 <title>Drupal facebook integration</title>
 <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/en/sessions/drupal-facebook-integration</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;English:&lt;br /&gt;
This session would be a detailed look into the functionality that facebook offers and how to implement all that power in drupal.&lt;br /&gt;
We would start with facebook popular concepts like &quot;Social Plugins,&lt;br /&gt;
Social Channels, Graph API and authentification&quot;.&lt;br /&gt;
Thereafter we would go through most of the important contributed modules that you can use for implementing the above mentioned concepts.&lt;br /&gt;
Lastly we would show you how to do some really cool stuffs from your own module like registering users and importing facebook profile to your profile content type in drupal.&lt;/p&gt;
